2026-07-27T08:54:39.1390795Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:54:39.1391500Z i /tmp/Rtmpw7vfZz/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:54:39.1391920Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:54:39.1392390Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:54:39.1393142Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:54:39.1393798Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:54:39.1394756Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:54:39.1395500Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:54:39.1666353Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:54:39.1785004Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:54:39.2256465Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:54:39.2426185Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
